# Custom Error Package (`packages/error`)

This package provides custom error types and error handling utilities for the Skyjo monorepo.

## Key Files & Directories:
- **[`src/`](mdc:packages/error/src)**: Main source code for error types and utilities.
  - **[`CError.ts`](mdc:packages/error/src/CError.ts)**: Custom error class implementation.
  - **[`constants.ts`](mdc:packages/error/src/constants.ts)**: Error codes and constants.
  - **[`index.ts`](mdc:packages/error/src/index.ts)**: Entry point for exports.
  - **[`test/`](mdc:packages/error/src/test)**: Test helpers for error handling (e.g., `expect-extend.ts`).
- **[`package.json`](mdc:packages/error/package.json)**: Dependencies and scripts.
- **[`tsconfig.json`](mdc:packages/error/tsconfig.json)**: TypeScript configuration.

## Notes
- Used by API, web, and workers for consistent error handling.
- Type-safe and extensible.